# Studio Salmera — Portfolio Site

A single-file portfolio + AI creative agency site for **salmera.online**.

Stack: Plain HTML/CSS/JS. No frameworks, no build step. Deploys free on GitHub Pages.

## File structure
```
portfolio_site/
├── index.html      ← the entire site (HTML + CSS + JS in one file)
└── README.md       ← this file
```

## To edit content (no coding needed)
Open `index.html` in any text editor (TextEdit, VS Code, Notepad). Look for the comments — they're marked `<!-- HERO -->`, `<!-- AGENCY / SERVICES -->`, `<!-- WORK -->`, etc. Edit only the text between the tags. Don't touch anything inside `<style>`.

For project images: drop image files in this folder and replace the `<div class="work-image"></div>` blocks with `<img src="your-image.jpg" alt="" class="work-image">`.

## To deploy
Follow `GITHUB_SETUP.md` (sister file). Five minutes, zero coding knowledge required.
